      "raw_md": "# Manifest — AUDIT → user\n\n## Version\n0.0.0\n\n## Last updated\n2026-05-03 by AUDIT bootstrap\n\n## Artifacts\n\n(Chưa có audit pass nào. Sau khi rebuild + publish_dashboard.sh fix, AUDIT sẽ\nchạy pass đầu và tạo `outputs/audit_report_<YYYY-MM-DD>.md`.)\n\nTemplate:\n\n```\n### audit_report_2026-05-DD\n- Path: outputs/audit_report_2026-05-DD.md\n- Manifest versions reviewed:\n  - FRAMEWORK: x.y.z\n  - DATASET: x.y.z\n  - VLM: x.y.z\n- Findings: <n_critical> critical, <n_error> error, <n_warn> warn, <n_info> info\n- Status: ready\n```\n\n### audit_report_paper_compare_2026-05-04\n- Path: outputs/audit_report_paper_compare_2026-05-04.md\n- Type: targeted (paper comparison — cs10k clean vs Chen & Zou 2025, arXiv:2508.11011v1)\n- Manifest versions reviewed:\n  - FRAMEWORK: 0.2.0\n  - DATASET: 1.1.1\n  - VLM: 0.1.0\n- Runs audited: descgen × {qwen25vl, internvl35, claude_sonnet} + safety_vqa × {qwen25vl, internvl35} + vlmdet × internvl35 (cs10k clean, n=500)\n- Findings: 0 critical, 3 error, 4 warn, 2 info\n- Status: ready\n\n## Removed/Deprecated\n(none)\n",
